{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create your own music video by controlling Miku Hatsune!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The process of clearing the riddles is all recorded, so you can create your own &quot;music video&quot; based on what you have done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The music video of TEMPLIME's song &quot;Koe ga shiru&quot; is the stage for this riddle-solving escape game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only move and click!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just move the pointer to the object you are interested in and proceed intuitively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you clear the game, you can play the hidden mode\u2049</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3646860?t=1744156194","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646860/a662edc5f01e900117a287bbd240215f2d06554f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744156194","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646860/10851b0704f246de64356e8f81a3a2d6747b66b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744156194","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646860/10851b0704f246de64356e8f81a3a2d6747b66b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744156194","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create your own music video by controlling Miku Hatsune!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The process of clearing the riddles is all recorded, so you can create your own &quot;music video&quot; based on what you have done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The music video of TEMPLIME's song &quot;Koe ga shiru&quot; is the stage for this riddle-solving escape game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only move and click!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just move the pointer to the object you are interested in and proceed intuitively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once yo